        <mxCell id="c20" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;" value="Legend: blue = Module 3, green = Module 5, orange = Module 9. Hollow triangle = generalisation (Borrower and Lender are both Booking parties, UC-B12 primary actor). Secondary actors from the use cases: Lender in B5; Borrower in B6/B7; Lender and Trust Engine in B8; Moderator in B12 are shown by the notes in the dressed use cases, not as separate lines, to keep the diagram readable. D6 hands over to I4 at D6 step 3 (no UML relationship drawn)." vertex="1">
